sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User/API client
 participant CRM as CRM service
 participant P as Partner/customer data
 U->>CRM: Submit lead/customer action
 CRM->>CRM: Authenticate, authorize, validate
 CRM->>P: Create/update partner when source flow permits
 P-->>CRM: Persisted identity/result
 CRM-->>U: Success or explicit error
 Note over CRM,P: Exact conversion fields and states require module/runtime evidence
